div.p:
Sir: I have the honor to refer to the
                    Department’s confidential instruction No. 543, July 3, 1946, enclosing a copy of a report on I. G. Farbenindustrie;
                    to the Embassy’s confidential despatch No. 320 [220], August 13, subject: “Reporting on Former P/L and Enemy Owned Firms”;
                    and to the Department’s confidential instruction no. 730, November 5, transmitting information regarding the
                    participation of I. G. Farben in five Peruvian firms.
